B.a4d=s(["Points work like TopLogger's: 5A is 500, 6A is 600, 7A is 700, and each half grade between adds a sixth (6B 633, 6B+ 650, 6C 667).","A flash adds 10 points, so a flashed 6A (610) still ranks below a worked 6A+ (617). A repeat scores half, and a climb you tried but didn't send scores nothing.","Your level is the average points of your 10 best sends in the last 2 months, divided by 10 even when you have fewer. The +% is how far that is toward the next half grade: 648 sits 88% of the way from 6B (633) to 6B+ (650).","Each send in the top 10 shows how many days until it drops out of the 2 months.","A session's grade works the same way, with only that session's sends."],t.s)
